      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Yes please.\n\nTo add to that, here's 2 threads that are closely related/possible limiting it from the intended use as described if it was implemented:\n\nhttps://feedback.vrchat.com/avatar-dynamics-reports-and-feedback/p/1194-feedback-immobile-mode-world-blend-multiplier\n\n-> Speaks about possibly blending the values, as in multipliers of eachother instead of separate values. e.g. if World was 1.0/full, you could have IK immobile be a percentage of it. More annoying on creator side, potentially less annoying on dev site.\n\nhttps://feedback.vrchat.com/avatar-dynamics-reports-and-feedback/p/feedback-allow-physbone-world-immobile-setting-to-reduce-rotational-movement\n\n-> Immobile set to world and put to max value still makes the root bone get affected by rotational changes.",
